# Module Catalog

This file owns shipped `module_key` values, package coverage, and status.

## Rules

- Seed shipped active modules from this catalog.
- Keep default permissions aligned with `permissions.mdc`.
- Keep package coverage aligned with `subscriptions.mdc`.
- Reset must restore the shipped mapping atomically.
- Admin changes must stay auditable and versioned.
- Planned modules must stay out of default seed data.

